{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36541","headline":"途中寄友人 · 罗邺","name":"途中寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋庭怅望别君初，折柳分襟十载余。\n相见或因中夜梦，寄来多是隔年书。\n携樽座外花空老，垂钓江头柳渐疎。\n裁得诗凭千里雁，吟来宁不忆吾庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36541.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36541","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}